From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tatsuki Tanaka <tatsuki@tanakatatsuki.dev>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 11:18:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] media: qcom: iris: VPU2 encoder ARP buffer in the secure
 non-pixel bank

The SM8450/SM8475 VPU2 encoder reads its ARP buffer through the secure
non-pixel stream ID (0x2184), which the hypervisor translates with
VMID CP_NON_PIXEL's stage 2. Give that stream ID its own context bank
(non-pixel child device), allocate the ARP pool from a reserved carveout
and assign it to VMID 0xb, and let arm-smmu-qcom build that domain's page
tables readable by the VMID. Enable it on xiaomi-marble.

---
